title: Watter's Ultimatum
subtitle: The army gives the Ruhr until the end of the month.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: crisis_ruhr = 1 and crisis_time >= 4
max-visits: 1
priority: 5
on-arrival: {!
Q.e20_ruhr_watter += Q.kapp_outcome == 3 ? 3 : 10;
var lost = Math.max(0, Math.round((Q.e20_ruhr_watter - Q.e20_ruhr_men * 0.6) / 6));
if (Q.e20_ruhr_dug) { lost = Math.floor(lost / 2); }
Q.e20_ruhr_towns = Math.max(0, Q.e20_ruhr_towns - lost);
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Towns held: ' + Q.e20_ruhr_towns;
Q.crisis_line_3 = 'Watter\'s troops at Münster: ' + Q.e20_ruhr_watter + ',000';
!}

= Watter's Ultimatum

On 29 March General von Watter issues his terms. Every weapon is to be handed in by 2 April, or the Reichswehr will cross the Lippe. [? if kapp_outcome = 3 : The workers' government has forbidden him to move, and he has not said whether he will obey. ?][? if kapp_outcome = 2 : He takes his orders from Lüttwitz now. ?]

The Red Army holds [+ e20_ruhr_towns +] towns. Its men are tired, and they are short of ammunition.

- @hand_in: Hand in the guns before the deadline.
- @fight: Hold the Lippe and fight.
- @dissolve: Send the men home, and get the cadres out.

@hand_in
subtitle: [? if kapp_outcome = 3 : Berlin has promised there will be no reprisals. ?][? if kapp_outcome = 1 : Whether Watter respects the terms depends on whether Berlin makes him. ?]
view-if: kapp_outcome != 2
on-arrival: e20_ruhr_final = 1
go-to: outcome

@fight
subtitle: [? if lock_uprising = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] The Red Army will need more men than Watter has, and enough towns behind it.
choose-if: lock_uprising < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids it.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_uprising == 1) { Q.unity -= 10; Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10; }
Q.e20_ruhr_final = 2;
!}
go-to: outcome

@dissolve
subtitle: The army will take the coalfield. Most of our people will be gone before it arrives.
on-arrival: e20_ruhr_final = 3
go-to: outcome

@outcome
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
var f = Q.e20_ruhr_final;
var holds = false;
Q.ruhr_peaceful = 0;
if (f == 1) {
    var p = Q.e20_ruhr_hagen ? 0.7 : 0.5;
    if (Q.bielefeld != 1 && Q.bielefeld != 3) { p = 0.2; }
    Q.ruhr_peaceful = (Q.kapp_outcome == 3 || Math.random() < p) ? 1 : 0;
} else if (f == 2) {
    holds = Q.e20_ruhr_men >= Q.e20_ruhr_watter && Q.e20_ruhr_towns >= 8;
}
Q.ruhr_red_army = holds ? 2 : 1;
Q.crisis = 0;
Q.crisis_kapp = 0;
Q.crisis_ruhr = 0;
Q.crisis_name = 0;
Q.crisis_goal = 0;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 0;
Q.crisis_line_2 = 0;
Q.crisis_line_3 = 0;
Q.crisis_momentum_label = 0;
if (holds) {
    Q.world_revolution += 8;
    Q.stability -= 10;
    Q.red_guards_strength = Math.max(Q.red_guards_strength, 30);
    RG.district('ruhr', {guards: 8, loyalty: 15, members: 0.15});
    RG.news('The Red Army throws back the Freikorps on the Lippe', 3);
    RG.ledger('The Ruhr Red Army threw back the Freikorps on the Lippe in April 1920.', 'e20_ruhr_held');
    if (Q.kapp_outcome == 2) {
        Q.kapp_junta_fell = 1;
        Q.government_name = 'Müller cabinet (SPD, Centre, DDP)';
        Q.chancellor = 'Hermann Müller';
        for (var p2 of Q.parties) { Q[p2 + '_in_government'] = 0; }
        Q.spd_in_government = 1;
        Q.zentrum_in_government = 1;
        Q.ddp_in_government = 1;
        Q.repression -= 20;
        Q.stability += 10;
    }
} else if (Q.ruhr_peaceful) {
    Q.red_guards_strength = Math.max(4, Q.red_guards_strength * 0.25);
    Q.stability += 5;
    RG.district('ruhr', {guards: -10, repression: -4, members: 0.1});
    RG.endStrike('ruhr', 'won');
    RG.news('The Ruhr hands in its guns: no reprisals', 3);
    RG.ledger('The Ruhr Red Army disarmed in peace in April 1920.', 'e20_ruhr_peace');
} else {
    var heavy = f == 2 || Q.bielefeld == 4;
    Q.red_guards_strength = Math.max(3, Q.red_guards_strength * (heavy ? 0.12 : 0.3));
    Q.red_guards_arms -= heavy ? 12 : 4;
    Q.repression += heavy ? 12 : 6;
    Q.spd_relation -= 10;
    RG.district('ruhr', {guards: -20, repression: heavy ? 30 : 15, militancy: -10, members: heavy ? -0.2 : -0.08});
    RG.endStrike('ruhr', 'crushed');
    RG.news('White terror in the Ruhr: the Reichswehr shoots its prisoners', 3);
    if (Q.kapp_outcome == 2) { Q.ending_id = 3; }
}
RG.districtSync();
!}

[? if ruhr_red_army = 1 and ruhr_peaceful = 0 and e20_ruhr_final != 3 : On 2 April the Reichswehr and the Freikorps cross the Lippe. The Red Army breaks in three days. Prisoners are shot "while trying to escape", and Red Army nurses are shot in the streets of Pelkum. More than a thousand workers are dead. ?][? if ruhr_red_army = 1 and ruhr_peaceful = 0 and e20_ruhr_final = 3 : The Red Army melts back into the pits before the deadline. The army marches in all the same, and the courts-martial sit for a month. Our district leaders are in Holland or in Saxony by then. ?]

[? if ruhr_peaceful = 1 : The rifles are stacked at the collection points, and the workers' defence units take over the towns. Watter is ordered back to Münster, and he goes. ?]

[? if ruhr_red_army = 2 and kapp_outcome != 2 : The Freikorps try the crossings at Haltern and Dorsten and are thrown back. The French warn that troops in the demilitarised zone will mean French troops in Frankfurt. Berlin stops. The councils still run the pits and the food supply. ?][? if ruhr_red_army = 2 and kapp_outcome = 2 : The Freikorps break on the Lippe, and then the dictatorship breaks in Berlin. On 6 April Kapp flies to Sweden after all, and Hermann Müller forms a government that owes its life to the miners of the Ruhr. ?]

[? if ending_id = 3 : The generals are masters of Germany, and the hunt for communists has begun in every town. ?]

- @save: Spend what we have hiding the survivors.
- @inquiry: Demand an amnesty and an inquiry, with the unions.
- @control: Keep the pit councils alive.
- @units: Register the defence units with the Prussian police.
- @republic: Proclaim the Soviet Republic of the Ruhr.
- @truce: Keep an armed truce with Berlin.
- @end: See how it ends.

@save
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. Most of the district leadership will survive.
view-if: ruhr_red_army = 1 and ruhr_peaceful = 0 and ending_id = 0
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
RG.district('ruhr', {loyalty: 8, members: 0.05});
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
!}

False papers, safe houses in Holland, railway tickets to Saxony.

@inquiry
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] The unions are ashamed of what the army did.
view-if: ruhr_red_army = 1 and ruhr_peaceful = 0 and ending_id = 0
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids a common campaign with the social democrats.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_united_front == 1) { Q.unity -= 10; Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10; }
Q.repression -= 4;
Q.uspd_relation += 5;
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
!}

An amnesty law passes for the rank and file. None of the officers who shot prisoners is tried.

@control
subtitle: The councils will argue coal accounts with the managers for as long as they last.
view-if: ruhr_peaceful = 1
on-arrival: worker_support += 3; lean_luxemburgist += 1

In the big pits the March councils refuse to dissolve. They inspect the coal accounts every Monday.

@units
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Legal, armed, and half of them ours.
view-if: ruhr_peaceful = 1
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids it.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_united_front == 1) { Q.unity -= 10; Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10; }
Q.red_guards_strength += 4;
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
!}

The defence units are entered in the registers of the Prussian interior ministry, names and all.

@republic
subtitle: [? if lock_uprising = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Moscow will cheer. Berlin will raise a new army for it.
view-if: ruhr_red_army = 2
choose-if: lock_uprising < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids it.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_uprising == 1) { Q.unity -= 10; Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10; }
Q.ruhr_soviet = 1;
Q.repression += 8;
Q.lean_offensive += 3;
RG.ecci('zinoviev', 6);
RG.news('Soviet Republic of the Ruhr proclaimed in Essen', 3);
RG.ledger('The Soviet Republic of the Ruhr was proclaimed in Essen.', 'e20_ruhr_soviet');
!}

The central council proclaims the republic from the Essen town hall. Berlin declares it null and void.

@truce
subtitle: The councils keep the pits, and the towns keep their mayors.
view-if: ruhr_red_army = 2
on-arrival: {!
Q.stability += 4;
Q.uspd_relation += 6;
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
RG.ecci('lenin', 3);
!}

The agreement is written down and signed in Bochum. Neither side expects it to last the year.

@end
view-if: ending_id = 3
go-to: game_over
